{"availability":"available","full":"MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2","name":"raven-platform-2","description":"Complete Platform Deployment for Raven MDI FHIR Reference Implementation","category":"Other","language":"PLpgSQL","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2022-09-26T18:36:41Z","updated":"2026-10-06T20:48:56Z","license":"MPL-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ravendocs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/","topics":["raven-mdi-fhir-ri"],"demo":"https://raven.heat.icl.gtri.org/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.334Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.334Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.334Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.334Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A reference implementation and testing platform for the HL7 FHIR Medicolegal Death Investigation (MDI) Implementation Guide. The Raven MDI Platform provides examples of MDI related operations, FHIR profiles, and workflows. The platform also provides additional features to support testing events such as document generation, document comparison, client and server interactions, and FHIR validation.","CONTACT THE DEVELOPERS AT: raven-support@gtri.gatech.edu","For version information, please see the individual component repositories. A list of major Raven repositories can be found in the GitHub Mortality Reporting space or by using the raven-mdi-fhir-ri topic."],"features":["The Raven MDI Record Viewer provides a user-friendly \"form\" style view of MDI FHIR documents, including MDI and EDRS Document Bundles, Toxicology Submission Message Bundles, and Death Certificate Review Document…","The Record Comparison tool allows a side by side comparison between a user generated MDI and EDRS record and known valid records based on established test cases uses for testing events.","Medical Examiners and Coroners (MEC) Case Management System vendors or other implementers generate records based on the supported test cases using their own system.","These records are copy and pasted into the comparison tool as complete FHIR Document Bundles.","The equivalent test case is selected from the Raven MDI FHIR Server."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3ab93cd300367b273fd9f557abcd182484303c16215f8327e74eca17db644a25","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.448Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.448Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A reference implementation and testing platform for the HL7 FHIR Medicolegal Death Investigation (MDI) Implementation Guide. The Raven MDI Platform provides examples of MDI related operations, FHIR profiles, and workflows. The platform also provides additional features to support testing events such as document generation, document comparison, client and server interactions, and FHIR validation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"This feature requires additional backend services to support stronger authentication, user login, and file storage.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Testing event participants login to the application and register for the event, and can work through the assigned event steps.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3ab93cd300367b273fd9f557abcd182484303c16215f8327e74eca17db644a25","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.448Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T20:48:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MortalityReporting/raven-platform-2/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:07.449Z","hash":"3ab93cd300